From: jason920612 <jasonya2206@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:09:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Share and trim per-object memory

Intern collision face shapes, allocate random-tick lists lazily, release
per-search pathfinding state, shrink drained tick queues, share advancement
trigger keys and structure template positions, and start small chunk
holder and entity slice maps.

